      "text": "The wave equation u_tt = c²∇²u is the archetype of **reversible, finite-speed propagation**.\nIt models acoustics, electromagnetism, seismology, and is the non-relativistic limit of many\nfield theories. Understanding it deeply gives you the template for all hyperbolic systems."
